# Scripts

## S4 family isotropy in the DEP sense (2026-11-17)

`verify_s4_dep_isotropy.py` certifies tasks C1-C5 of
[`S4_DEP_ISOTROPY_GATE.md`](../theory/S4_DEP_ISOTROPY_GATE.md) (frozen
`9188755`) for the s=4 family at theta = pi/4, a symbolic in (0,1):
nonzero transition matrices, Klein-group covariance with sigma_l ⊗ I,
transitivity, homogeneity condition (2) of arXiv:1708.00826 with exact zero
sets (rational arc parametrization, gcd, Sturm roots), projective
representation. Run 1 stopped on a solver limitation (retained); run 2
gives `DEP_ISOTROPIC_IN_DECLARED_L`. Does not certify other theta, groups or
generating sets, the other assumptions of 1306.1934, novelty, or c_0 itself
(certified elsewhere for this family).
Erratum (Astra review, 2026-11-17): the docstring lists "P projectors"
among sanity checks; none is executed explicitly. Gamma_i are checked to be
Hermitian involutions, from which P_i^± are projectors. The file is left
unchanged because it has been reviewed. The "UNDECIDED" branch is
unreachable.

```sh
python3 -B scripts/verify_s4_dep_isotropy.py
```

## Prior-art check: Di Molfetta-Arrighi 1D speed (2026-11-17)

`verify_prior_art_dimolfetta_1d_speed.py` supports the source check in
`investigaciones/2026-11-17-c0-causal-body-prior-art/comprobacion.md`.
Nine exact SymPy 1.14.0 checks on the massless alpha=0 walk of
arXiv:1906.04483v2 (Eqs. (1)-(3), Thm III.1 (iii)): unitarity,
cos Omega(2 steps) = 1 - 2c^2 sin^2 k, low-energy speed c per step, and
nonzero extreme coefficients (strict causal body [-1,1]) for every 0<c<1.
Not a gate certificate; does not certify anything beyond that 1D walk, nor
whether it lies in D'Ariano-Perinotti's isotropy class. Run 1 failed the
two unitarity checks for a symbol-assumption reason (recorded in the file).

```sh
python3 -B scripts/verify_prior_art_dimolfetta_1d_speed.py
```

